Living Systems is an unofficial, server-side mod for Empyrion: Galactic Survival (Eleon Game Studios SA), developed
against the Reforged Eden 2 scenario. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Eleon Game Studios or the Reforged Eden
team.

This repository contains only the mod's own source code and build scripts. It contains no game files: the game's
ModApi.dll, Mif.dll and UnityEngine.CoreModule.dll are referenced at build time from a local game install
(EMPYRION_REFS) and are not included or redistributed. Game prefabs, configs and assets referred to by name in the
code belong to their owners and are not included either.

AI assistance: much of this code was written with Anthropic's Claude (Claude Code), directed, tested and reviewed by
the author.
